### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json

### GET all artists
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists
Accept: application/json

### GET artist by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists/1
Accept: application/json

### GET artist paintings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artists/1/paintings
Accept: application/json

### GET paintings with pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/paintings?page=1&size=6
Accept: application/json

### GET paintings with filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/paintings?artistId=1&yearFrom=1880&yearTo=1900&sort=year-desc&page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json

### GET painting by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/paintings/101
Accept: application/json

### GET missing painting - negative case
GET http://localhost:8080/api/paintings/999999
Accept: application/json

### POST create artist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Kazimir Malevich",
  "birthYear": 1879,
  "deathYear": 1935,
  "country": "Ukraine",
  "movement": "Suprematism",
  "description": "Avant-garde artist and theorist.",
  "portrait": "/images/placeholder.svg"
}

### POST duplicate artist - conflict case
POST http://localhost:8080/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Claude Monet",
  "birthYear": 1840,
  "deathYear": 1926,
  "country": "France",
  "movement": "Impressionism",
  "description": "Duplicate-name API test.",
  "portrait": "/images/monet.svg"
}

### POST create painting
POST http://localhost:8080/api/paintings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "QA Test Painting",
  "artistId": 1,
  "year": 1889,
  "genre": "Post-Impressionism",
  "museum": "QA Test Museum",
  "description": "Painting created for CRUD API testing.",
  "image": "/images/placeholder.svg"
}

### POST painting with non-existing artist - negative case
POST http://localhost:8080/api/paintings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Orphan QA Painting",
  "artistId": 999999,
  "year": 2020,
  "genre": "QA",
  "museum": "QA Museum",
  "description": "Reference integrity test.",
  "image": "/images/placeholder.svg"
}

### PUT full update artist 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/artists/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Vincent van Gogh",
  "birthYear": 1853,
  "deathYear": 1890,
  "country": "Netherlands",
  "movement": "Post-Impressionism",
  "description": "Updated through PUT for QA testing.",
  "portrait": "/images/van-gogh.svg"
}

### PUT full update painting 101
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/paintings/101
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "The Starry Night Updated",
  "artistId": 1,
  "year": 1889,
  "genre": "Post-Impressionism",
  "museum": "Museum of Modern Art, New York",
  "description": "Updated through a PUT request.",
  "image": "/images/starry-night.svg"
}

### PUT missing required fields - negative case
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/paintings/101
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Only title"
}

### PATCH one artist field
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/artists/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "country": "QA Country"
}

### PATCH one painting field
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/paintings/101
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "museum": "QA Test Museum"
}

### PATCH unknown field - negative case
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/paintings/101
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "unknownField": "test"
}

### DELETE existing painting
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/paintings/603
Accept: application/json

### DELETE missing painting - negative case
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/paintings/999999
Accept: application/json

### DELETE artist that still has paintings
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/artists/1
Accept: application/json

### Wrong Content-Type
POST http://localhost:8080/api/artists
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Wrong Content Type"
}

### Invalid JSON
POST http://localhost:8080/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken JSON",
}

### Unsupported method
POST http://localhost:8080/api/health
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### OPTIONS
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/paintings
